I got killed by another bug; I'm still using Patch Level 5 so maybe
it's fixed now?

I read a blessed scroll of genocide.  I didn't notice that it was
blessed or that the message asked me
	What class of monster do you want to genocide [Type the letter]
instead of the usual
	What monster do you want to genocide [Type the name]

So I typed ice troll , since I was already MEAN enough to kill rock trolls.
And it hung.  Just hung there.  I went and took out the garbage, and
when I came back it was still hanging there.  I hit DEL a few times,
and then hung up when that didn't work.  I don't remember if there
was a save file; if so (I think there was) it dumped core when I
restarted it.  Arrgh!

I wouldn't be all that annoyed if it genocided whatever monster class
started with "i" and then did whatever the command "ce troll" did.
It would be even better if it reminded me to type only one letter.
But hanging is just not cool.

